# Base URL of the TestFlight server. Use an http(s) origin only: no path, query,
# fragment, or credentials (for example, http://10.0.2.2:8080 is valid;
# http://10.0.2.2:8080/api is not). The in-app Settings tab can override this at
# runtime without rebuilding.
# Emulators reach the host machine through 10.0.2.2; physical devices need the
# host's LAN address (or `adb reverse tcp:8080 tcp:8080` plus http://127.0.0.1:8080).
#
# You can also override it per build: ./gradlew :app:assembleDebug -Pserver_url=http://127.0.0.1:8080
server_url=http://10.0.2.2:8080
